Reading: at every eps tested, sup_{z>=y} h_eps(z) does NOT grow with
y -- it is of order eps for y large, consistent with h_eps(z)->eps as
z->infinity (since R(z)~1/z, |1-eps z|~eps z for large z). No growth
in y anywhere. Independently confirms (does not merely trust) the
qualitative finding of DISC-DEC-113 / the referee report's Finding H1.
